OL,3,GNEWSAReports of melted roads rise by
OL,4,A67% in three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of cases of roads melting in
OL,7,Fthe East of England has risen by 67% in
OL,8,Fthe past three years, data obtained by
OL,9,Fthe BBC shows.
OL,11,FThe region's highways authorities
OL,12,Freported more than 200 cases of melting
OL,13,Froads in the past four years, following
OL,14,Fthe BBC's request for information.
OL,16,FExperts said that part of the problem
OL,17,Fwas caused by most UK roads being
OL,18,Fdesigned for cooler weather rather than
OL,19,Fprolonged periods of "extreme heat".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
