OL,3,GNEWSAReports of melted roads rise by
OL,4,A67% in three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Transport (DfT) said
OL,7,Fit was supporting local highway
OL,8,Fauthorities to improve the resilience
OL,9,Fof road networks through guidance,
OL,10,Ftools and resources.
